<!-- Agent lifecycle & MCP discovery — Mermaid -->

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant Dev as Developer
  participant CSharp as csharp-mcp-server
  participant Core as Brunella Core (Node)
  participant MyAI as myai (Python)
  participant MCP as MCP Discovery
  participant Registry as agents/registry.json

  Dev->>CSharp: optional warmup (launch.ps1 -WarmupOnly)
  Dev->>Core: npm run dev (start Node backend)
  Core->>MyAI: start Python subsystem (uv sync && uvicorn)
  Core->>MCP: query mcp_servers.json
  MCP-->>Core: list of available MCP servers & tools
  Core->>Registry: load agents registry (agents/registry.json)
  Registry-->>Core: agent metadata, entrypoints
  Core->>MCP: register MCP tools (auto-discovery)
  Core-->>Dev: status: "ready" (all MCP tools available)
```

```mermaid
flowchart TB
  subgraph Runtime
    CoreNode[Brunella Core]
    MyAISvc[Python myai]
    MCPsvc[MCP servers]
    AgentRegistry[agents/registry.json]
  end
  CoreNode --> MCPsvc
  CoreNode --> AgentRegistry
  AgentRegistry --> MCPsvc
  MCPsvc --> CoreNode
  MyAISvc --> CoreNode
```
